RELNOTES: On Windows, [`--experimental_strict_repo_env`](https://bazel.build/reference/command-line-reference#flag--experimental_strict_repo_env) now keeps `SYSTEMROOT` and `SYSTEMDRIVE` in the repository environment.

Closes #32440

